  ✔ uses the actual deviation for the portion behind the aircraft (0.261221ms)
  ✔ joins actual track naturally to the current aircraft without an obsolete filed-route jump (0.105457ms)
  ✔ starts projection at the current aircraft and never selects a segment behind it (0.127408ms)
  ✔ keeps Route and Weather on the same canonical story samples (1.170771ms)
