  ✔ renders filed fixes as zoom-stable white markers without sample markers (0.409819ms)
✔ FlightAware filed route references (1.005059ms)
▶ AAL3197 weather entry rendering
  ✔ orders samples in direction of travel and discards points behind progress (0.254241ms)
  ✔ renders the numbered marker at the affected-range entry coordinate (12.810779ms)
  ✔ leads with the next weather event once and keeps its entry timing and shared map wording (3.753014ms)
  ✔ does not split one continuous moderate range when storm detail changes (0.627644ms)
  ✔ combines contiguous light and moderate turbulence into one passenger event (0.626792ms)
✔ AAL3197 weather entry rendering (18.564942ms)
